# GCP best practices (2026)

Align new infra and service config with current Google Cloud guidance:

| Area | Practice |
|------|----------|
| Compute | Cloud Run (prefer gen2), request-scoped concurrency tuning, CPU boost where justified |
| Data | Firestore **Native** mode only; composite indexes as code |
| AI | Vertex AI via platform controller; use **cached content** patterns already used by grounded chat |
| Security | Secret Manager; WIF for CI; DLP + Cloud KMS for regulated document flows |
| Network | Prefer VPC Service Controls / private paths where org policy requires |
| Artifacts | **Artifact Registry** (not legacy GCR) |
| Observability | Structured logs to Cloud Logging; metrics for SLIs on API/workers |
| Cost | Budgets/alerts; tenant AI spend caps (`tenant.aiLimits`) |

