## Do not

- Introduce GCE VMs or unmanaged GKE for default app hosting without an explicit decision
- Call Vertex from ad-hoc scripts in production paths outside `runAiRequest`
- Log prompts containing PII when DLP redaction is required

## Enforcement

- Terraform + CI
- AI controller / spend rules
- Security review on new GCP APIs

